            <ArticleTitle>Pulmonary artery dissection in a patient with Eisenmenger syndrome treated with heart and lung transplantation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>228-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a patient with known Eisenmenger syndrome due to congenital ventricular septal defect, who developed pulmonary artery dissection. The patient was successfully treated with heart and lung transplantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
